<p>Non-deliverable				 28     76     118</p>
<p>CCC						827    827     829</p>
<p>TOTAL					  8,116  5,661   7,254</p>
<p>						    HUTCHINSON AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				 20,622 17,607   4,545</p>
<p>Non-deliverable				203    200     142</p>
<p>CCC					    2,558  2,558   1,887</p>
